{"3826840": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "No One Here But Me", "steam_appid": 3826840, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>You got a job as a night administrator at a small computer club. There aren't many visitors at night, and the job seems simple: keep order, serve customers, and close the club before morning.</strong><br><br>But among the ordinary visitors, there are sometimes those who <strong>shouldn't be here</strong>.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >CHECK THE VISITORS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Keep an eye on everyone who enters the club. Talk to customers, observe them, use the security cameras, and watch for anything unusual.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Not every anomaly reveals itself right away.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >GET RID OF THE ANOMALIES</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you discover something abnormal, simply telling it to leave may not be enough.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find the items you need, search for clues, and figure out how to force the anomaly to reveal its true form.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >THE NIGHT ISN'T OVER YET</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Finishing your shift successfully doesn't mean the night is over.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some anomalies don't want to leave.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>You got a job as a night administrator at a small computer club. There aren't many visitors at night, and the job seems simple: keep order, serve customers, and close the club before morning.</strong><br><br>But among the ordinary visitors, there are sometimes those who <strong>shouldn't be here</strong>.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >CHECK THE VISITORS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Keep an eye on everyone who enters the club. Talk to customers, observe them, use the security cameras, and watch for anything unusual.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Not every anomaly reveals itself right away.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >GET RID OF THE ANOMALIES</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you discover something abnormal, simply telling it to leave may not be enough.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find the items you need, search for clues, and figure out how to force the anomaly to reveal its true form.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >THE NIGHT ISN'T OVER YET</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Finishing your shift successfully doesn't mean the night is over.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some anomalies don't want to leave.</p>", "short_description": "Work as a night administrator at a computer club, check visitors, detect anomalies, and survive nightmare-filled nights full of monsters and mysteries.", "supported_languages": "English, Russian, Traditional Chinese, Korean, Japanese, Simplified Chinese, French, Italian, German, Spanish - Spain, Polish, Portuguese - Brazil, Turkish", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3826840/f76eb477cf0009848f1331fdb8ce070a35e26c68/header.jpg?t=1787222954", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3826840/69ebee415d43f86b8db06738dcdb69386adba774/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1787222954", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3826840/69ebee415d43f86b8db06738dcdb69386adba774/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1787222954", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Dual Core CPU<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> GTX 1650 / RX570</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Dual Core CPU<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16 MB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> GTX 1650 / RX570</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": [], "linux_requirements": [], "developers": ["Blue Cat studio"